    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "columns"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "The details"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Two approaches, two philosophies."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Quinn chose editorial fiction. Caresse chose personalized generation. The promise isn't the same."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "columns-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Caresse</p>\n                <h3>Listen first. Decide later.</h3>\n                <p>Before any purchase, you get access to pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish. No sign-up, no account, no email: you hear right away the sound quality, the voice, the atmosphere and the intensity levels. The demos don't speak your name or use your profile, but they faithfully reflect what you're about to experience.</p>\n                <p>When you start a bespoke session, Caresse builds a scenario from your profile: who you are, what you go by, what you want tonight, the intensity, the atmosphere. The voice names you. It's not a story written for an anonymous audience — it was only ever generated for this session. Anonymous mode requires no Caresse account; purchases use your Apple or Google account.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Audio demos playable without an account (EN · FR · ES)</li>\n                    <li>100% anonymous use — no account creation, even to pay</li>\n                    <li>Names spoken aloud in the narration</li>\n                    <li>Duration varies with generation; exact length is not a setting</li>\n                    <li>Essentially infinite combinations: genders, practices, accessories, intensity, setting, atmosphere</li>\n                    <li>Native couple and solo modes</li>\n                    <li>No subscription: you pay per session</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card muted"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Quinn</p>\n                <h3>The go-to US library of audio stories.</h3>\n                <p>Quinn offers a catalog of erotic audio stories, written by authors and performed by creators and voice performers, in English. The production quality is well regarded. The catalog is updated regularly and spans a wide range of scenarios and tones.</p>\n                <p>A possible fit if you want a large fiction audio library and English works for you — as far as we can tell, Quinn has no French or Spanish version. Less of a fit if you want an experience generated for you and your partner, with your names spoken aloud, or if you'd rather not create an account first.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Broad catalog of pre-recorded stories</li>\n                    <li>Polished audio production, creators and voice performers</li>\n                    <li>English-only content, no other language available</li>\n                    <li>Built for individual fiction listening</li>\n                    <li>Subscription: $7.99/month or $59.99/year</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
