                "class": "price-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Caresse</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Per session</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">Free download and demos. Personalized sessions use paid credits, without a subscription.</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:0.85rem;\">Euro amounts are indicative. Prices may vary by country and store; check the amount shown in the app before purchasing.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding-top:14px;\">\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>1 experience</span>\n                        <strong>€1.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>3 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€5.49</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>5 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€7.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;\">Once generated, each experience is yours forever — available any time on your account and in the app.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\">\n                    <span>Unlimited Exploration (one-time, lifetime)</span>\n                    <strong>€9.99</strong>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.8;\">Unlocks advanced personalization options + 1 free credit.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Quinn</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Subscription</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\">$7.99/month or $59.99/year for unlimited access to all audios.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-footnote"
          },
          "html": "Quinn pricing recorded 28 August 2026 on Quinn’s official website."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "choose"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How to choose"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Honestly, who should pick what?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "No spin. Here's who each app is best for."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "choose-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card us"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>to listen to real audio demos before paying, no account required</li>\n                    <li>to use the app fully anonymously — no sign-up, ever</li>\n                    <li>the voice to call you and your partner by your actual names</li>\n                    <li>an experience generated for you, not a story written for everyone</li>\n                    <li>to set the exact duration, intensity, practices and atmosphere</li>\n                    <li>to pay only for what you listen to, with no idle subscription</li>\n                    <li>a solo mode as polished as the couple mode</li>\n                    <li>Generated audio in EN, FR, ES and PT (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card them"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Quinn if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>a large erotic audio fiction catalog, and English works for you (no other language available)</li>\n                    <li>stories written by authors, performed by voice actors</li>\n                    <li>mostly individual listening, audiobook-style</li>\n                    <li>a classic subscription format, no configuration per listen</li>\n                    <li>to browse a catalog rather than generate a bespoke experience</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub",
            "style": "margin-top:24px;"
          },
          "html": "Prefer a French-language library instead of English? See our comparison with <a href=\"/en/vs-melba/\">Melba</a>. Want a text format instead of audio? Check out <a href=\"/en/vs-melt/\">Caresse vs Melt</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Quinn — your questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I listen to Caresse before paying, without creating an account?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Caresse offers pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish, playable immediately — no sign-up, no email, no account. You hear the sound quality, the voice, the atmosphere and the intensity levels before any decision. Demos don't use your name or profile, but they faithfully reflect the experience."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse require an account like Quinn?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. Caresse is fully anonymous: no account creation is ever required to use the app. Even purchases happen without an account. That's a structural difference from Quinn, where signing up is a prerequisite to access the catalog."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What's the main difference between Caresse and Quinn?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Quinn is a US library of erotic audio stories: a large catalog of pre-recorded stories in English, subscription-based, built for passive listening, solo or as a couple. Caresse generates a unique scenario every session: your names are spoken aloud, duration varies with generation, intensity, practices and atmosphere are configured by you. It's a guided, personalized experience, not a library of fiction to browse."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse run on a subscription or pay-per-session?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse is pay-per-session — no mandatory monthly subscription. You pay when you want a new experience, you don't pay for months you don't use it. Quinn runs on a subscription: $7.99/month or $59.99/year, regardless of how often you listen."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse offer as large a catalog as Quinn?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Not in the same sense. Quinn has a large catalog of stories written by authors, fixed and updated regularly. Caresse doesn't offer a catalog to browse: every session is generated on demand from your intimate profile, with an essentially infinite combination of genders, names, practices, accessories, intensity and atmosphere. You never replay the same thing, and you're not waiting on a release calendar."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Quinn work in languages other than English?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "To our knowledge, Quinn is English-only, with no French or Spanish version available. Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval. Free demos are in French, English and Spanish."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Quinn or Caresse: which one for a shared couple experience?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Quinn is built primarily for individual fiction listening, even if some stories work for a couple. Caresse has a native duo mode: both partners' names are woven into the scenario, and the experience is designed as a shared, guided moment — not the reading of a third-party story."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
